# Book metadata (later steps of the metadata extraction work)
 - Reader: side panel with the metadata form, saved with AJAX
   (e.g. /api/book/<sha1>/metadata), instead of the "à relire" badge link
 - Review queue (/bookadmin/review): thumbnail, suggestions, "Valider /
   Corriger / Passer", next book; ordered by decreasing score
   - opt. accept in bulk the suggestions above a score (e.g. >= 80)
 - book_list: authors, year, editor and review state columns, "à relire"
   filter, metadata coverage rate
 - Library (browser_lazy): authors and year in the tooltip of the books
 - Search views on the new criteria: author, editor, year, ...
 - Book directory reorganization from the metadata: simulated plan, then
   moves with move_book, with an undo journal
 - OCR of the key pages of PDF without text (PyMuPDF get_textpage_ocr,
   Tesseract)
 - Local catalog (Open Library dumps, or CSV) to complete a book from its
   ISBN
 - Write the validated metadata in the PDF (XMP): changes the sha1, so in a
   copy, as for the cover page
 - Local file of publishers (e.g. in instance/, set by a config key), which
   extends srcs/metadata/publishers.json without changing the repository
